messages/mentions; existing preference/archive/read routes, direct and room conversation creation, and the Phase 
4/legacy compatibility tests pass; `npm run test:messaging:local:e2e` passes; Presence DB suite passes if any 
presence-related path is touched (presence-safety rule); RLS review gate recorded.
