**Summarizing final review considerations**

I'm reviewing how to format a detailed report with prioritized findings, focusing on several high- and medium-severity 
issues related to authorization, concurrency, and data privacy. I'm weighing whether all high-severity findings need 
fixing now or if some medium ones require further verification, aiming to deliver a clean, user-appropriate summary.
